290 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 240 0 R
/E (This project proposes a multimodal AI framework for brain tumour diagnosis and monitoring. The system integrates 3D Attention-U-Net based segmentation, federated tumour classification, and longitudinal tumour progression forecasting. Federated learning enables multiple hospitals to collaboratively train models while keeping patient data private. A Quantum Particle Swarm Optimization \(QPSO\) based aggregation strategy improves federated learning convergence. The system also predicts future tumour growth from longitudinal MRI scans using mathematical models and LSTM networks. The integrated pipeline provides segmentation maps, tumour classification, growth prediction, and clinical risk assessment, enabling intelligent clinical decision support.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
